Compare Remote Config between two projects

Usage:
  fbrcm projects diff <source-project> <target-project> [flags]

Flags:
      --cached[=true|false]       Use cached Remote Config instead of live Firebase fetch
      --conditions[=true|false]   Include only condition changes
      --expr string               Filter parameter changes by expr-lang expression
  -f, --filter stringArray        Filter parameters by mode-prefixed query (^, /, ~, =); may be repeated
      --group stringArray         Select parameters in group; may be repeated
  -h, --help[=true|false]         help for diff
      --json[=true|false]         Print diff as JSON
      --parameters[=true|false]   Include only parameter and group description changes
      --search string             Search parameters by name, description, values, and conditions

Global Flags:
      --include-hidden[=true|false]    Include projects hidden by the profile blacklist or whitelist for this invocation
      --no-local-config[=true|false]   Ignore .fbrcm.toml repository configuration (env: FBRCM_NO_LOCAL_CONFIG)
      --profile string                 Use profile for this invocation without changing the active profile (env: FBRCM_PROFILE)
      --stateless[=true|false]         Run a supported command without profiles or application-managed local state (Firebase API token env: FBRCM_GOOGLE_ACCESS_TOKEN)
      --timeout duration               Maximum duration for the complete command
